// Each custom creature uses its own QC dialog file.
COMPILE ~CotSC/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM01.d~ USING ~CotSC/translation/%LANGUAGE%/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM01.tra~
COMPILE ~CotSC/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM02.d~ USING ~CotSC/translation/%LANGUAGE%/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM02.tra~
