COMPILE ~CotSC/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM07.d~ USING ~CotSC/translation/%LANGUAGE%/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM07.tra~
COMPILE ~CotSC/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM08.d~ USING ~CotSC/translation/%LANGUAGE%/QCMM/dialogue/QCMM08.tra~
